      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "yeah it makes very little sense to even have the silence shape as well.. they made all shape keys shut off anyways. \n\nIt's kinda pointless that if the game knows there's no sounds being made why not just make silence the only shape key active????\n\nSure it's not difficult to close a characters mouth like I had to. but if you have a couple hundred custom shape keys for the face like I intend to for my own models. I will need to either close the mouth before doing so making shape keys the literal last thing I do or go through making sure my mouth doesn't get fucked up after hours if not days of work.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5d49ca20c05a7269067748ee",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68",
        "alias": "Evolutionary Vicuna",
        "aliasID": "65ba088fed6eefce4ca8dc62",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/a96149971e91f0ceb638e9e86cef2b08.gif",
        "created": "2018-04-09T03:11:40.225Z",
